      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 352,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "### To use the MCP server\n1. Go to Submitrax.com\n2. Create a free account if you don't already have one.\n3. Go to settings in the left menu\n4. Scroll down to API access\n5. Create an API token, copy it\n6. In Submitrax MCP -> Create a Bearer Auth credential and paste your token there"
